  "display_title": "Good Morning, Wife",
  "description": "*“I will take care of you. I will do my best until you are happy.”* \n\nI was planning to find an investment company to expand my business, but the proposal sent to me and Jin Yi-young included information about 'contractual marriage'. The opponent is Koo Gyo-Heon, who is known for being an asshole. But it's not that bad of a deal. I thought they would just live as a show window couple, but this man. He keeps approaching me. Weren't we married by contract?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
